  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2def4b25b5fcbf3400b5b4ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一緒に最高速を目指しましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81585908d614833b6c7a8e9e893e893d74d8ec980e0434fea57962a95179f1ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35339fe0c489c8ffe528a60c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "初めて会った時は…チャック、\r\nそしてテープで遅刻し一直線。\r\nうん、そんな感じでした！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5eb4f943f00389e111883949243db7efc6730b758c29562cb6d1cc26656a0bd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83d9a64efe0ae57b89335dca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "健全な学生生活を送らねば、ですね。\r\n早寝早起き、早予習！",
      "source_fingerprint": "105cca0818dfaa2fedba25ead0b5ad422d0d74aa9b2c4679374a238cfe2c1d29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c6ad7ec7841f8b69d7a6acf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フッ。光り輝くなら、\r\nやはりセンターが1番だな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f40ca89cc011fa5a86a36fc9b1d8e651980ffa04f69f5212b0250c933b81710",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c259f01b9c514b85c27547a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肉眼ではとらえられませんよ。\r\nこの服で走る私はね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7312bc3cd2f5838f7a9fa5d639f90d43ff5ca55b83bf5e17d64a9284b947aed5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f50b2b754654d95735f7c1e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "シワは皆無です。一直線のシワなら\r\nギリ許してもいいですが。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44ca01fed751df273e1f1de24dbe708d7285e8465e9473b97f5167d055273129",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e720467b04d2e8ef1c2fc95a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "曲のテンポが光速に近づくほど、\r\n私は燃える！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba56dddf1d1c861129dcd2db326f57d7c767384bef996a356fa2404d89b56dae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e996eac86d49cf5cff97a39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この衣装…やはり、\r\n心に真っ直ぐ線が通るな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d806b992923540d63f640d0b50956b33b6603450151a09a5dbe6f20b02d0c28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4260c644e9e87086b0291b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "着慣れた服であれば5秒以内。\r\n早着替えも最速です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30d32bd14ad00f2d16ac75c30df7b5fe6c6dc593067a38f54ae4d2bf5223a96e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0b11730de3241309a3f1cf5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おや、猫の毛が…。\r\nもっと！もっとついてないか！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8692e7cfbeee73212ee1cbece91dab0b768005c8f863f7ef83ba6d74bf1d70a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b5cf35cf686642c678604d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "健全な学生生活を送らねば、ですね。\r\n早寝早起き、早予習！",
      "source_fingerprint": "105cca0818dfaa2fedba25ead0b5ad422d0d74aa9b2c4679374a238cfe2c1d29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d96fa6f169a857dcb774e80c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フッ。光り輝くなら、\r\nやはりセンターが1番だな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f40ca89cc011fa5a86a36fc9b1d8e651980ffa04f69f5212b0250c933b81710",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a396f7e0aa69a69df7ad05c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肉眼ではとらえられませんよ。\r\nこの服で走る私はね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7312bc3cd2f5838f7a9fa5d639f90d43ff5ca55b83bf5e17d64a9284b947aed5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96355c0145603fe89f375eab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "シワは皆無です。一直線のシワなら\r\nギリ許してもいいですが。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44ca01fed751df273e1f1de24dbe708d7285e8465e9473b97f5167d055273129",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:997f51f6e7442fb94d232b24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "曲のテンポが光速に近づくほど、\r\n私は燃える！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba56dddf1d1c861129dcd2db326f57d7c767384bef996a356fa2404d89b56dae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:958fd558f517b296da3cb746",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この衣装…やはり、\r\n心に真っ直ぐ線が通るな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d806b992923540d63f640d0b50956b33b6603450151a09a5dbe6f20b02d0c28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:334498c34645381db8d3d886",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "着慣れた服であれば5秒以内。\r\n早着替えも最速です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30d32bd14ad00f2d16ac75c30df7b5fe6c6dc593067a38f54ae4d2bf5223a96e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8d3de7cc4d8b6711e3805db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おや、猫の毛が…。\r\nもっと！もっとついてないか！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8692e7cfbeee73212ee1cbece91dab0b768005c8f863f7ef83ba6d74bf1d70a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77904ee251d11d76089d60b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れ様です",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba6d317ce3a2bfaf3d87ba426113b0a3498828395ba8d093265eb3539b78c491",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9079eff2be144c37448e93c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おはようからおやすみまで。\r\n今日も今日とて\r\n一直線に駆け抜けていきましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cd5b6c00dada084c99d9917fa8db6cdc2f65d9660fb76d3532dfea94b939b3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb3b8d49fbcac9e0341c8f32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝6時に起きるのが私の習慣です。\r\n絶対6時。断じて6時。\r\nだって時計の針が一直線ですから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6bf67cf2e1c1344a1b3392698732c1548214b0059b965de63dab0b8b6530748",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2089e440e06048f3952c9f6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フッ、お昼の時間か。1時限目\r\n時点で早弁した私には無用…\r\nいや。やっぱりお腹空きました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ba56cc6bbf22e61682a0edbf294e787e902f31f8692000fbb0fe0a75b661393",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1839e07d44b7f5ec753a206",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食後の授業は眠いですが…大丈夫。\r\nそういう時は、脳内のホエザルに\r\n起こしてもらえば一発です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e9c1bdb1b22602190fd32e8feefce9ff404cb74dff2297522303cf334519947",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11bf3a827d3571196929ed22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日も残すところあと少し…いわば\r\n最終直線！最後まで気を抜かず…\r\nふぁ～～ああ…行きましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8f9a3249b8fe2c092e34c1b14b0358033ab749e944230e27db56b020d44f354",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33fefffc43c1ca6f025738f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の寝相は常に完璧、真っ直ぐな\r\n気をつけ姿勢。毎朝、規則正しく\r\nベッド脇の定位置に落下しています",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7b9984f1a95568817a030f702966e5c1c87820af97323363c17229a5e4eee1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a5ad72c738d67e8c7c8f409",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日から私、お花見生活です。\r\nああ、週末お花見することになった\r\nので、今から公園で場所取りをと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "775ea5dc54fdcddfbd0e60d08b66345246eeb4f88c591cb7a00ae1856d11dcb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30d64fae111974e1fb0a06ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この灼熱も、脳内の熱帯雨林で\r\n繰り広げたジャガー軍団との\r\nレースに比べたら、何のその…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8e5c19e5425cb5e8dffa44081612e54cc34333ddebb7a3d6b9d0724bfb859e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:219034cbe8925faa88765950",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "速読の秋、早食いの秋。\r\nフッ…私の最高速を存分に\r\nお披露目できる季節が来たな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73e8cc9830ab5632a2d628e08c0bfb4d14107a5eeff490fc97c2bb70f205f753",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9eea1bb6990cdcafeaf0ba1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乾燥の季節、クリームの装備は必須\r\nですからね。乾燥を感知しだい取り\r\n出せるよう袖口に備えています。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5c8fb3a52b969917019191f15b60b93026eec862d8096c74dbdd6284cf1a068",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cb081826fc2bc6eac1aed86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バレンタインですね",
      "source_fingerprint": "df378f9c19407569b84c5dcf3b3a8adc3fc2d5e1a1f540f4d81ad34db8009cf6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efdde2f6fd3bb71610e1e136",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の髪は常にぱっつん、真っ直ぐ、\r\nずーっとです。小さい頃お母さんが\r\n初めて整えてくれた時から、ずっと",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d757b8d97c7a22a0869ec52a67cf2eca8964f83e54f6cdc4792abf60eb977e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:944cdfebc134e7575422696f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昔は算数や数学が好きだったのに、\r\n裏切られました。内容が進むたびに\r\n曲線が出しゃばってきて…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c10e6072c0d4a3dec3d815448e34c4a903c073adfee82826b673c47c3761f188",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b3273cc8a68fbbdb8737cef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ときどきデュランダルと箒とかで\r\n戦うのですが…『光速直線突き』が\r\nいつもいなされる…なぜだっ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "055b0048e09ec8be8e2c37efd251f7fc52b0a363367158d80ccd5a313712d4fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f5e1a70025dd9f724be1a95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "皆、ビリーヴを規範とすべきです。\r\n背筋も机もタオルの折り目もぴんと\r\nきちっと真っ直ぐなのですから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f1cbaf509643082ad6e220941d8dfc999b487a626751ea5379998c0ace1a0f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88d01e261c81dc0efaa0aa13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タキオンが“光”に関係する実験を\r\nしていると聞きました。よくわかり\r\nませんが、私も協力すべきですね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b86ea90f57dbb4d17a66c7329fd29a0d8091858f81dedd13ddf67a4b9b7507fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28c3f2c31f98c6a9ce6f825b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "せっかくの衣装、1曲舞いましょう\r\n…ソーラン節とか。光速を超える\r\nキビキビの舞、ご覧にいれます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a0c2543a21e6396e8e3718c064f566afec08bbff0ac8e6d14768e4c1387f841",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8407b32043840f467eb542d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の光速ダンスについてこられる\r\n生地はそうありませんからね。\r\n見事な出来映え。あっぱれです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0de5270e2d612c13b2eb95ef454249e8168cae58665e862f871dd1a9842557dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82109c9362eab53d386f72c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝負服はウマ娘の魂…\r\n日々アイロンをかけ、よりよい\r\n直線を保ってゆかねば。",
      "source_fingerprint": "057e7b2bb6c2e0bf5ae933f3dc537de773fb4edec88a11f71b851f7853658a8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83f5110b5028103d4daf52d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "腰ひもの結び方にはこだわりが\r\nあります。意地でも丸みは\r\nおびさせませんとも…ええ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6053cd754d66b7a4cc79f5e1e3c2377c19a806c487f84884f5be9ae60be76a60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f851dc82709c30963b43982f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の髪は常に真っ直ぐ。\r\n寝ぐせなど見つけた朝には\r\nオイルでばしゅんの即KOです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff7a915495bbe806212fd8abd97bf65da38a74829f87db73e18d1488aa49cbcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acb410188668fd3781e5d33c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "近々カフェテリアに短期間限定の\r\nメニューが出るとか。短期間…\r\n誰よりも、最速で味わわねば！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d094c9353db719e2df0cec3e2135297aa73a0efc4742d2f6c88e7088cf39840",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8347137cfc241822cd072b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "むっ！？暗がりに光る目…！\r\n猫！？きっと猫に違いないっ！\r\n早急に確認してこなければっ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5eddf5c4a0b4e898f8730bdc51afd2e715e8074696acc376ddf1bce9d6269b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f15c7c564d24817cab044d86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衝撃波で花々を散らすのは\r\nさすがに忍びない…。\r\n光速走行は少し控えておくか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0eb33cc3f369b775e211968361f536542684861721ba334a6c76e84aee9fdb5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2726866db942f89b67883fcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太陽光線め…暑さで私の弱体化を\r\n狙っているのか。フッ、速さで\r\n抜かれるのがそんなに恐ろしいか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "765a634ca0f72e2634478cb36abc5b13e5abab4b0ea6bfb4ba94be30e2123d1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b7ce2a03fb6756ccd91d3d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "焼き芋を焼こうと考えていたり\r\nしませんか？するでしょう？\r\nご安心を。準備はもうできています",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3143fe30b19ba5ffae8bcb01e50b3c2d8b53d46ce9a1625591571890316605d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96baae1d73b097a12cd48794",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "地面が凍ってしまいますからね。\r\nトレーニング中も気をつけないと。\r\n…いや？真っ直ぐ滑るならありか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "38e2adfa2b70661f4091034f9b3efcaef7925883f9c66c3c9e1e806058b21370",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b607442ebc79fd2dd6692817",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成長曲線だなんて曲がったものは\r\n要りません。右斜め上にシュッと\r\n真っ直ぐ伸ばす感じでいきましょう",
      "source_fingerprint": "e43a968184b72d7e0c779b3f14690ee1d76a75e0cc7ea37209eb15a29729980f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b119d4e64e0b75a1744d04d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最速で……ゆくぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ee8591157f7ee34cd619257865507955af4a12d1eb1815e127f9342cbaad062",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71435915b616cfa6dcf267bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて。今日も真面目に一直線。\r\nたったかたーといきましょうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02f5bcaf080e3aba04fe5d5a4b5863eeb42832e1b805561e59148feb9f7a32a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87422d1725a84e8e1f493931",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "考えながらトレーニングしなければ\r\nなりません…。最速レコードの\r\nインタビューの内容についてを…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a5d04a65ac705592551602731275df7d146b23e14da7af134c6b71d523ae3e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bba4cb87e0b798b9403db1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学業のほうは問題ありませんよ。\r\n学園で使う教科書は全て、秒で\r\n読み終えましたからね。フッ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e269e2e19f841268e91832b5cd9af8b1c906a4eecce5f6f826cb3e5cac577a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cb83fb82eba7aa622aa1829",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最速、それはロマン！\r\nともに追いかけましょう！\r\n一直線に！",
      "source_fingerprint": "443b87b58b47b75f940d1ac84a3a0251bc05317c7f20f7bc0bd94fa3a0f57c69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65f13c2b3a772ba1b72ed1d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私には見えますよ。トレーナーの\r\n心はハート型じゃない…私と同じ\r\n直線定規の形をしている！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9b30c5f9d06b507b9eb506d9d78e8ce69ec99586d3281be15f08b74d3cf616e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e041e8abfda1f81e40da4521",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方となら、光の先へ行けるはず。\r\n今はまだでもいずれ、必ず。\r\n確信しています。貴方もでしょう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c244fbb5eeb9f05a154ef750af0c148c0e21de9ab871cbc6b9019c1c558e6641",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62eaa89d360d77ef8cf136d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "泳ぐと、妙に体が浮いてしまって…\r\nくっ、私はクラゲじゃない…！\r\n百歩譲ってカジキマグロだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a31596e0667c9660f63084bb7ea3692de96ac5e316fabbfafabb20ed9da10192",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebb7f321bf38143551667c1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "次なる目標は私自身…貴方となら余裕ですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5223ea0367306e63109325a811ef74ca4cb371c8b72d995838c2b6053d8fbfdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f38c1af0ba42743f020ae98d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一直線、共に歩めて楽しかったです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a303a3d9e2111117982d8b920a99fe6fb0801a2e01a44b894864d6fbb86e5b4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73f84d4b4611b35d39bb7e86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高速、更新っ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e28db24f2186b1fff8a55042789d8cd68b5d9b82ba65098d2bd786ac08d14bb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8cc64cf99a3ed7110098443",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フッ、いっそ限界を知りたいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9e5fe729febaf3d0ecdcf0f16ac7e806ed27f5ad69c36a0e22e1910cc07815f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33f66e024ec845447b7d8575",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カルストンライトオ、最速です。\r\nよろしくお願いします。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffa36a00f8714465399a3c5b5761a7f673cee20278764c48f04c7ffe2eba31c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c2cf80402c4e442770adf49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フッ、見えますか？\r\n光をも超えるこの脚が！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab962ecb8ec9f0f9e52d29543085f1ad2b9bc8eb17b89bb704d1de7d992ee54f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1120",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5322d90035d09dd0ddfe44d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备好了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e36fbccc1afd0f573cd3d8f897e3488e4336d872375cc4340fe31a60f44d59c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3407b3f7d6936fce3902831e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您是我命运的起点……\r\n作为获得了主君的骑士，\r\n这份喜悦无法用言语表达。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e378a01295c994a8460669210186c1018ff9c762f6612a973f588d77d3ac34c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb6d593dbc44a2df2fc17d40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8c1b4ca00ad36969e30922d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc905259a5064e0f6c75b9fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "或许还有许多，\r\n我还不曾完全了解的您。\r\n今后……请继续教导我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e98c200e9cb2dbda6bb6c4273ef4821b9b380e2d9b29c9806a15fea4b15b234b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e0e9927fd7e8abeb37294ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使在光芒无法触及的黑暗中，\r\n我也会牵着您的手同行。\r\n——这是我作为骑士的骄傲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc452d663caaf3f13a3c0c17e703de093af8d41f3bbfccfe6056d1264ce1eca4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c1bbdd38aa32a6382020847",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\r\n初升的太阳那纯洁的光芒，\r\n仿佛象征着骑士应有的心境。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7aab1ec4ec2fe41d19d6e807ddac7e02a6deb2e44845bde98dd29f841df5ada",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c716231e17372193f3db9bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您喜欢巧克力吗？\r\n我将带着日常的感激与敬意献上。\r\n请笑纳。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90870cb66a751243da82f889fe51810dd7b23e93e7300fa542c1af4b6a6d6ab0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:024010da8cd38f31cfef7148",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "依照您的口味亲手制作的巧克力……\r\n美味吗？哦……是这样啊……\r\n嗯，呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60ebd7cd79c3fa251e2cf3ce40dc2f79ed424863bc6e68f37eae1d54d1887ba2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9398ea99fbe6c0a3d62a552",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "七夕……若下雨，\r\n我便化作一颗星星照亮天空，\r\n宛如一把锐利的圣剑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11d159e18db578ee73468583467cdb810f9b47e531ccbcd2667e26ebaff47936",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c1969c38e1de79c072971b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节要装扮成无头骑士吗……？\r\n不，骑士不该用来装扮，\r\n更何况……呃，咳咳。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90580e15e31bb67184e22670aa7366dc1be3c3a81319abfa245e3409028850b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2924913d68316e9abc78b9b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "信念无论对待什么事情\r\n都非常认真，\r\n就连装饰圣诞树时也是一丝不苟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70bed1250f64bccac38ee31a1a98eefd83d56ae3242c840d34cde854a37d873a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:339e9816f9b107467c71697f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在这神圣的夜晚……\r\n请允许我再次发誓，\r\n我将成为不会让您蒙羞的利刃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ae8262e8eaea4c6a0b220086df81b9e2917111ac787fe0987f563a0830a6440",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0400a049b32d49330929876f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们的心连成一体。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e99235850baf1ea148510c0825c1990a8c1b76f1ed3c56cb5e163229ba7caac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bc58c78dd641690ada25466",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "腊月……虽不谈它的词源，\r\n但作为骑士，\r\n无论何时都应从容不迫，泰然自若。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d91bdc25d73c70b781aa04ba3d20bce52233b5f49a8c6ca33aa541e654c28525",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:937051fd6d1d05ed239302c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是您的生日，\r\n不如召集百姓一起盛大庆祝……\r\n诶？不需要吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f52ad7329010f7fa5bd9894830d17504f9141fe1224333ecea4f75588f0755e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cda010a0de50dd6c8aaaa8c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衷心为您庆贺。从您诞生的那天\n起，命运或许就已开始运转\n了吧？呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd9374031f53a4a706ac49303aaf2b79e98e6c62f31411369ebc6bcc1007b001",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf71f00c1b5b7be546ef00c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "金镇之光送了我一把尺子。\r\n说每年都要延长一段……\r\n十年后的生日会怎样呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1261a34db62595b74a57b8fac06e7de48b4ba40626494231cb924aa02d673fc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fa0f4983380960d959bed35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日礼物？……不，\r\n我已收到您的忠诚……\r\n这就足够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02277b1164fabe01d8a0190d077f587bd4afeb09a272c7dd3ad980cd7b4fd3bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10014"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
